dogecoin.text:
@BabyDogeCoin I don't know who came up with these but saying "liked Doge Coin" makes it seem like Dogecoin used to exist. Change it to "like Doge Coin."

Also, there's no space between "doge" and "coin." It's simply "Dogecoin."

Just remember, Baby Doge wouldn't exist without Dogecoin.
